sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Buyer as Buyer (client app)
    participant RT as Real-time Sync (SignalR)
    participant TEN as Tenant Management Subsystem
    participant SO as Sell Offer Subsystem (Trading)

    Note over Buyer,SO: SCENARIO A - connection drops and reconnects

    Buyer--xRT: Connection lost
    RT->>RT: Heartbeat missed, client marked stale
    Note over Buyer: Client disables all Purchase buttons and shows a reconnecting banner
    SO-)RT: OfferStateChanged events continue (versions advance)
    RT--xBuyer: Cannot deliver, client offline

    Buyer->>RT: Reconnect with token, subscribe to pair
    RT->>TEN: Validate identity and tenant visibility
    TEN-->>RT: Allowed
    RT->>RT: Rejoin the pair group
    RT->>SO: Read current offers and depth with versions
    SO-->>RT: Snapshot
    RT-->>Buyer: Snapshot, then live events newer than the snapshot versions (no gap)
    Note over Buyer: Buttons are enabled only for offers that the snapshot shows as Available

    Note over Buyer,SO: SCENARIO B - gap detected while connected

    SO-)RT: OfferStateChanged (offer X, version 12)
    RT-)Buyer: Event version 12
    Buyer->>Buyer: Client holds version 10 for offer X, gap detected
    Buyer->>RT: Request resync (pair)
    alt Missed events still in the durable backlog
        RT-->>Buyer: Replay of the missed events in order
    else Not available
        RT->>SO: Read current offers and depth
        SO-->>RT: Snapshot
        RT-->>Buyer: Snapshot replaces local state
    end

    Note over Buyer,SO: SCENARIO C - stale click, button still enabled on an out-of-date screen

    Buyer->>SO: Purchase click on an offer that is already locked or gone
    SO-->>Buyer: Rejected OFFER_LOCKED with retryAfter, or OFFER_NOT_AVAILABLE
    Buyer->>RT: Request resync (pair)
    RT-->>Buyer: Snapshot or missed events
    Note over Buyer,SO: The server is the authority. A stale screen can cause a rejected click, never a double sale

    Note over Buyer,SO: SCENARIO D - Real-time Sync unavailable for everyone (open decision)
    Note over Buyer,SO: Hard dependency: trading is halted until sync returns. Soft dependency: trading continues, screens go stale, the server rejects invalid clicks